        "column_dNFcwV": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Indian Patented",
            "text": "<p>Introducing our Patented Clear Whey Protein Isolate an advanced, innovative formula designed for maximum absorption and digestion. This light, refreshing, and easy-to-mix protein supplement is crafted for seamless use anytime, offering a perfect solution for muscle recovery, growth, and everyday performance, helping you elevate your fitness goals.</p>",
