        "text_LTgjzp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Dosage: </strong>For optimal results, consume Protyze Anytime Clear Whey Protein according to your fitness goals. Generally, take one scoop with water for post-workout or as a protein supplement.</p><p><strong>Preparation: </strong>Shake one scoop of Protyze Anytime Clear Whey Protein with water for a juicy & refreshing protein-packed drink to fuel your fitness.</p><p><strong>Consumption: </strong>Experience the benefits of Protyze Anytime Clear Whey Protein by consuming one scoop either in your pre, intra or post-workout as a convenient protein supplement. Elevate your nutrition with this transparent and effective protein solution.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
