    "collapsible_content_7TKPdU": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_76epJh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. Can I take whey protein everyday ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can take whey protein daily to support muscle recovery and growth. It's a convenient and effective way to meet your protein needs, aiding overall fitness and well-being.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_g7m67n": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. What happens after stopping whey protein ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>After discontinuing whey protein, your body retains muscle gains if you maintain a balanced diet and regular exercise. Adjust your protein intake from whole foods for sustained results. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hiULQq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. How many times a day can I take protein powder ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Optimal protein intake depends on your goals and lifestyle. Generally, consume protein powder 1 times a day to support muscle growth, recovery, and overall nutritional needs. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8Bc3RD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Where do the amino acids in protyze anytime Whey come from ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The amino acids in Protyze Anytime Clear Whey are sourced from high-quality whey protein, providing a complete profile of essential amino acids vital for muscle repair, recovery, and growth. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_x8x6nd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. Do your products contain banned substances ?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, our products are rigorously tested to ensure they are free from banned substances. We prioritize safety and quality, offering you trusted supplements for your health and fitness journey.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KYKEg8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Can I take whey protein everyday?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, it's safe to consume whey protein daily as it provides essential amino acids crucial for muscle repair and growth, supporting your fitness goals effectively. Protyze clear whey protein is free from artificial colors, low in carbs, 99% lactose-free, fat-free, and contains zero added sugar which is ideal for fitness enthusiasts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tN4Xpc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Can i make clear protein drink with 100 ml water?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, to prepare the clear protein drink you must take a minimum of 300 ml of water add one scoop shake it vigorously, and let it rest for 30-50 sec for the foam to settle, and then your drink is ready.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
